Laravel kya hota hai?

👉 Laravel ek PHP backend framework hai

Matlab:

Website ka backend (server side) banane ke kaam aata hai
Data, database, login, API sab handle karta hai
⚙️ Simple meaning

👉 Frontend = jo user dekhta hai (Angular, HTML, React)

👉 Backend = jo behind the scenes kaam karta hai (Laravel)

🏗️ Laravel kya karta hai?

Laravel ye sab kaam easy bana deta hai:

1. 🔐 Login / Signup system
User register
Login
Password security
2. 📦 Database handling
Data save karna
Data fetch karna
Update / delete

(MySQL, MongoDB etc.)

3. 🌐 API banana

Frontend (Angular) ko data bhejna:

Example:

/api/students
/api/colleges
4. 🧾 CRUD operations
Create
Read
Update
Delete
5. 🛡️ Security
Password hashing
Authentication
Middleware protection